upload/t_thumb/sc107fj.jpg"}, {"id": 1689248, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc107fk.jpg"}, {"id": 1689249, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc107fl.jpg"}, {"id": 1689250, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc107fm.jpg"}, {"id": 1689251, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc107fn.jpg"}, {"id": 1689252, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc107fo.jpg"}, {"id": 1689253, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc107fp.jpg"}], "slug": "plague-hunters", "summary": "In shadowed realms where plague winds howl and moan,\nPlague Hunters calls, a rogue-like throne,\nTurn-based tales in dark fantasy's grip,\nWhere survivors and hunters join your fateful trip.\n\nEach run a riddle, randomized anew,\nLevels rise like ghosts from the misty blue,\nGather your party 'midst the cursed decay,\nIn a world devoured by plague's grim sway.\n\nWith art like fairytales twisted and torn,\nBeautiful darkness where nightmares are born,\nBattle grotesque foes, bosses foul and vast,\nEquip potent perks to endure the blast.\n\nShrines whisper secrets, a gamble profound,\nLuck's fleeting kiss or a curse tightly bound\u2014\nVenture forth, hunter, in this plague-wrought dream,\nWhere victory's edge cuts on fortune's sharp gleam.\n\nDirected by Luc Bernard.", "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/plague-hunters"}